  "title": "V2X Names Mike Uster Chief Information Officer to Advance Enterprise Technology Strategy",
  "summary": "RESTON, Va., — V2X, Inc. (NYSE: VVX) today announced the appointment of Mike Uster as Chief Information Officer, effective immediately. In this role, Uster will lead the company’s global information technology strategy, enterprise systems, and digital transformation initiatives, with a focus on strengthening cybersecurity, advancing AI-enabled capabilities, and enabling secure, resilient technology platforms that support […]",
